# Secrets and approval

- Never hardcode API keys. Use `.env` / environment only. Do not paste secrets into docs or chat.
- Do not run **print** or **void** against live ShipStation unless the supervisor already said **yes / do it / fill / run**.
- Prefer convert dry discovery / clear order lists before print when the ask is ambiguous.
